From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seuj09 <jeus110310@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:35:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: sprd: give the X6525's GPU its stock DVFS table

The stock kernel's gpu@23100000 node carries the GPU's operating points;
the mainline one has none, so Panfrost runs at whatever rate the
bootloader left and never scales. Add the four points the mainline GPU
clock can actually select (fixed parents at 384, 512, 614.4 and 768 MHz)
with the stock voltages. The fifth point, 850 MHz at 0.80 V, needs the
GPU PLL to be programmed rather than a fixed parent, so it is left out
until that path is tested.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums9230-infinix-x6525.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums9230-infinix-x6525.dts
index c1db2cc..1528ac6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums9230-infinix-x6525.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums9230-infinix-x6525.dts
@@ -726,8 +726,44 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+/*
+ * GPU DVFS. The frequencies and voltages are the stock kernel's own table for
+ * this GPU (operating-points in its gpu@23100000 node): 384 MHz @ 0.70 V,
+ * 512 MHz and 614.4 MHz @ 0.75 V, 768 MHz @ 0.80 V. The stock table also has
+ * 850 MHz @ 0.80 V, which the mainline GPU clock has no fixed parent for - it
+ * would need the GPU PLL to be programmed - so it is left out until that path
+ * is tested. Without an OPP table Panfrost runs at whatever rate the
+ * bootloader left and never scales.
+ */
+/ {
+	gpu_opp_table: opp-table {
+		compatible = "operating-points-v2";
+
+		opp-384000000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <384000000>;
+			opp-microvolt = <700000>;
+		};
+
+		opp-512000000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <512000000>;
+			opp-microvolt = <750000>;
+		};
+
+		opp-614400000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <614400000>;
+			opp-microvolt = <750000>;
+		};
+
+		opp-768000000 {
+			opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <768000000>;
+			opp-microvolt = <800000>;
+		};
+	};
+};
+
 &gpu {
 	mali-supply = <&vddgpu>;
+	operating-points-v2 = <&gpu_opp_table>;
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
